Computational Steering Equation

Define

M=(S,F,E,P)

where

* S = semantics
* F = form
* E = epistemic status
* P = pragmatic intent

A receiver applies some reasoning function

R(M,C)

where

C is context.

The optimization target is not

\max I(M)

(maximum information)

but

\max
P(R(M,C)=T)

where

T is the intended reasoning trajectory.

